      },
      "message": "Document and enforce worktree-based development\n\n- AGENTS.md Working style: work in a worktree, default outside the repo at ../worktrees/<branch-slug>\n- AGENTS.md Repo conventions: keep the main checkout clean and retire worktrees with git worktree remove\n- .gitignore: add .worktrees/ as a safety net for agents that use the in-repo path\n- scripts/review.sh: refuse to run from main outside REVIEW_MODE=docs and point agents at the worktree add command\n- tests/test_readme.py: assert the new AGENTS.md guidance and the .worktrees/ ignore\n- tests/test_app.py: assert the review.sh guard blocks main in full mode and allows it in docs mode, using a stubbed git binary to keep the test self-contained",
